Thank you very much for your reply and for your explanation.

I understand that the document you sent contains both your company
registration information and your trademark registration information.

Unfortunately, the PDF file I received is of quite low resolution, so some
parts of the document are difficult to read clearly, including the details
of the issuing authority and some of the registration information.

